WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[On screen: No internet. Not a recording. Listen. Airplane mode is turned on and Wi-Fi is turned off.]

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.900
I went to the woods because I wished to live deliberately,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.800
to front only the essential facts of life,

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.600
and see if I could not learn what it had to teach,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.100
and not, when I came to die, discover that I had not lived.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.000
[On screen: Every word, made on your phone. Listen2.]
